"Du sendes til en sikker kasse for betaling. Selger:": "You are sent to a safe box for payment. Seller:",
"Du sendes til en sikker kasse for betaling. Selger: Ludispel (MARTINEZ LOZANO INTERNASJONAL HANDEL, org.nr 935 407 095 MVA, Oslo). Totalpris inkl. 25 % MVA og frakt (79 kr i Norge) vises før du betaler. Estimert levering 5–20 virkedager. 14 dagers angrerett – du betaler selv returfrakten. Trygg betaling med kort.": "You are sent to a safe box for payment. Seller: Ludigames (MARTINEZ LOZANO INTERNASIONAL HANDEL, or. No. 935 407 095 MVA, Oslo). Total price incl. 25% MVA and shipping (79 kr in Norway) appear before paying. Estimated delivery 5-20 working days. 14 day right of withdrawal – you pay your own return. Safe payment by card.",
